# self-update-fixture-log-mutants drives copies of ONE file, the reconcile runner under test, through
# the worlds of its sibling fixture. The runner sources its siblings in the reconcile directory, so
# that directory is declared whole. The sibling fixture (lib.sh, seed.sh, run.sh) and the preamble
# are read directly; the runner's gate and scripts read core/scripts and the hook directory.
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/
!core/skills/ai-dlc-update/reconcile/self-update-fixtures.sh
core/fixtures/self-update-fixture-log/
core/fixtures/lib/
core/git-hooks/pre-push
core/scripts/hermetic-run.sh
core/scripts/core-paths.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc-update/SKILL.md
